#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:4
msgid "Multi-GPU and Multi-Node Training"
msgstr "多 GPU 和多节点训练"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:6
msgid ""
"Scale one reinforcement learning job across the GPUs in a workstation or "
"across several nodes with ``train_multigpu``. Isaac Lab starts one training "
"process per GPU, gives each process its own simulation environments, and "
"synchronizes policy updates across the processes."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``train_multigpu`` ，可将一个强化学习作业扩展到工作站的多个 GPU 或多个节点。Isaac Lab 为每个 GPU "
"启动一个训练进程，各进程拥有自己的仿真环境，并在进程间同步策略更新。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:11
msgid ""
"The same launcher model is used in three multi-GPU benchmarks for measuring "
"startup, simulation, and end-to-end training performance."
msgstr "同一种启动方式也用于三种多 GPU 基准测试，分别测量启动、仿真和端到端训练性能。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:16
msgid ""
"Multi-GPU and multi-node training requires Linux and NVIDIA NCCL. Windows is"
" not supported."
msgstr "多 GPU 和多节点训练需要 Linux 及 NVIDIA NCCL，不支持 Windows。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:21
msgid "``train_multigpu`` is experimental and may change in a future release."
msgstr "``train_multigpu`` 属于实验性功能，后续版本可能变化。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:24
msgid "Start a multi-GPU training run"
msgstr "启动多 GPU 训练"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:26
msgid ""
"First, verify that the task trains on one GPU. This separates task or "
"configuration problems from distributed-launch problems:"
msgstr "先验证任务能否在单个 GPU 上训练，以区分任务/配置问题与分布式启动问题："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:33
msgid "Then run the same task on every visible GPU:"
msgstr "然后在所有可见 GPU 上运行同一任务："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:39
msgid ""
"That is the complete transition from a single-GPU run. ``train_multigpu`` "
"adds ``--distributed`` and selects the distributed launcher automatically. "
"All other arguments are the same arguments accepted by ``train``:"
msgstr ""
"这就完成了从单 GPU 运行的切换。 ``train_multigpu`` 自动添加 ``--distributed`` "
"，并选择分布式启动器。其他参数与 ``train`` 接受的参数相同："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:50
msgid ""
"``--num_envs`` is the number of environments **on each GPU**. With four GPUs"
" and ``--num_envs 4096``, the job collects experience from 16,384 "
"environments in total."
msgstr ""
"``--num_envs`` 是 **每个 GPU 上的** 环境数量。使用四个 GPU 和 ``--num_envs 4096`` 时，作业总共从 "
"16,384 个环境采集经验。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:54
msgid ""
"All ranks write into one run folder. Each rank trains with the launch seed "
"plus its rank on its own GPU. Rank 0 writes its settings "
"(``params/env.yaml`` and ``params/agent.yaml``) and videos where a single-"
"GPU run does; every other rank writes its own ``params/`` and videos to "
"``rank_<rank>/``."
msgstr ""
"所有 rank 写入同一个运行目录。各 rank 在自己的 GPU 上训练，种子为启动种子加自身 rank。rank 0 将设置（ "
"``params/env.yaml`` 和 ``params/agent.yaml`` ）及视频写入与单 GPU 运行相同的位置；其余 rank "
"将自己的 ``params/`` 和视频写入 ``rank_<rank>/`` 。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:61
msgid ""
"Add ``--dry_run`` to print the resolved launcher command without starting "
"training. This is useful when checking GPU counts, rendezvous options, or "
"forwarded training arguments."
msgstr "加入 ``--dry_run`` 可打印解析后的启动命令，而不开始训练，适合检查 GPU 数量、会合选项和转发的训练参数。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:66
msgid "Choose the GPUs"
msgstr "选择 GPU"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:68
msgid ""
"By default, the launcher uses every visible GPU. Set ``--num_gpus`` when you"
" want a specific worker count:"
msgstr "启动器默认使用所有可见 GPU。需要指定工作进程数量时，设置 ``--num_gpus`` ："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:75
msgid ""
"Use ``CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`` to choose the physical devices. The launcher "
"sees only the devices in that list:"
msgstr "使用 ``CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`` 选择物理设备，启动器只能看到列表中的设备："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:83
msgid ""
"Run ``nvidia-smi`` before launching to confirm that the expected devices are"
" available and have enough free memory."
msgstr "启动前运行 ``nvidia-smi`` ，确认预期设备可用且有足够空闲显存。"

