msgstr "运行各基准测试时，使用与 ``train_multigpu`` 相同的启动选项："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:160
msgid ""
"``training_multigpu`` supports RSL-RL, RL-Games, and skrl with PyTorch. It "
"does not support skrl with JAX or SB3. It also rejects ``--video`` and "
"``--capture_env_sensors``, which do not produce a meaningful aggregate "
"result across ranks. ``--check_success`` is supported with RSL-RL and RL-"
"Games: the success metric is averaged over the environments of all ranks, so"
" every rank stops at the same iteration."
msgstr ""
"``training_multigpu`` 支持基于 PyTorch 的 RSL-RL、RL-Games 和 skrl，不支持基于 JAX 的 skrl"
" 或 SB3。它也不接受 ``--video`` 和 ``--capture_env_sensors`` ，因为这些选项不能产生有意义的跨 rank "
"汇总结果。RSL-RL 和 RL-Games 支持 ``--check_success`` ：成功指标在全部 rank 的环境中取平均，使所有 rank"
" 在同一迭代停止。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:167
msgid ""
"For multi-node benchmarks, pass the same ``--nnodes``, ``--node_rank``, and "
"rendezvous options described in :ref:`multi-node-training` on every node."
msgstr ""
"多节点基准测试中，在每个节点传入 :ref:`multi-node-training` 所述的 ``--nnodes`` 、 "
"``--node_rank`` 和会合选项。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:171
msgid "Read multi-GPU benchmark results"
msgstr "读取多 GPU 基准测试结果"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:173
msgid ""
"Only global rank 0 writes a result bundle. The ``extra`` fields record the "
"rank layout and clarify which measurements the bundle covers:"
msgstr "只有全局 rank 0 写出结果包。 ``extra`` 字段记录 rank 布局，并说明结果包覆盖的测量范围："

