msgid "Rank layout of the job."
msgstr "作业的 rank 布局。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:184
msgid "``num_envs_per_rank``"
msgstr "``num_envs_per_rank``"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:185
msgid "Environments hosted by each rank."
msgstr "每个 rank 承载的环境数量。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:186
msgid "``workload_scope``"
msgstr "``workload_scope``"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:187
msgid ""
"``global`` for ``training_multigpu`` because ranks train in lockstep. "
"``rank0`` for ``startup_multigpu`` and ``runtime_multigpu`` because each "
"rank runs independently and only rank 0 is measured."
msgstr ""
"``training_multigpu`` 为 ``global`` ，因为各 rank 同步训练。 ``startup_multigpu`` 和 "
"``runtime_multigpu`` 为 ``rank0`` ，因为各 rank 独立运行，且只测量 rank 0。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:190
msgid "``measurement_scope``"
msgstr "``measurement_scope``"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:191
msgid ""
"``rank0_process``: timings, learning curves, CPU, and RAM come from rank 0 "
"alone."
msgstr "``rank0_process`` ：时间、学习曲线、CPU 和 RAM 数据仅来自 rank 0。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:193
msgid "``gpu_measurement_scope``"
msgstr "``gpu_measurement_scope``"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:194
msgid ""
"``rank0_node``: ``resources.devices`` reports every GPU visible to rank 0. "
"GPU utilization and memory values remain scoped to rank 0's device."
msgstr ""
"``rank0_node`` ： ``resources.devices`` 报告 rank 0 可见的全部 GPU。GPU 利用率和显存值仍仅对应 "
"rank 0 的设备。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:197
msgid ""
"When comparing one GPU with multiple GPUs, keep ``--num_envs`` constant "
"**per rank**. An N-GPU job processes N times as many environments as the "
"one-GPU job at the same per-rank setting. Compare the global throughput of "
"``training_multigpu`` against N times the single-GPU throughput. Do not "
"treat ``startup_multigpu`` or ``runtime_multigpu`` as aggregate rates; they "
"measure rank 0 while the other ranks create host contention."
msgstr ""
"比较单 GPU 和多 GPU 时，保持 **每个 rank 的** ``--num_envs`` 不变。在相同逐 rank 设置下，N 个 GPU "
"的作业处理的环境数为单 GPU 作业的 N 倍。应将 ``training_multigpu`` 的全局吞吐量与单 GPU 吞吐量的 N 倍比较。不要将"
" ``startup_multigpu`` 或 ``runtime_multigpu`` 当作汇总速率；它们测量的是其他 rank 造成主机资源竞争时的"
" rank 0。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:205
msgid "How multi-GPU training works"
msgstr "多 GPU 训练的工作原理"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:207
msgid ""
"For PyTorch workflows, ``train_multigpu`` wraps `torchrun "
"<https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/elastic/run.html>`_. It launches one "
"process per GPU. Each process owns:"
msgstr ""
"在 PyTorch 工作流程中， ``train_multigpu`` 包装 `torchrun "
"<https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/elastic/run.html>`_ ，为每个 GPU "
"启动一个进程。各进程拥有："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:211
msgid "one Isaac Lab application and its vectorized environments,"
msgstr "一个 Isaac Lab 应用及其向量化环境；"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:212
msgid "one copy of the policy,"
msgstr "一份策略副本；"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:213
msgid "one rollout buffer, and"
msgstr "一个轨迹采样缓冲区；以及"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:214
msgid "one GPU selected by its local rank."
msgstr "由本地 rank 选择的一个 GPU。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:216
msgid ""
"The processes collect experience independently and synchronize gradients "
"during policy updates with `DistributedDataParallel "
"<https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/notes/ddp.html>`_. Simulation does not"
" move between GPUs, so available host CPU, RAM, and I/O can become limiting "
"factors as the GPU count grows."
msgstr ""
"各进程独立采集经验，在策略更新期间通过 `DistributedDataParallel "
"<https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/notes/ddp.html>`_ 同步梯度。仿真不会在 GPU "
"之间迁移，因此 GPU 数量增加时，主机 CPU、RAM 和 I/O 可能成为限制因素。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:222 source/features/multi_gpu.rst:228
msgid "One training process and simulation workload per GPU"
msgstr "每个 GPU 对应一个训练进程和仿真负载"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:235
msgid "Read logs from distributed runs"
msgstr "读取分布式运行日志"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:237
msgid ""
"Every rank produces similar startup messages, warnings, and model summaries."
" The launcher shows local rank 0 by default so the console remains readable."
" Training metrics already come from global rank 0, and a crash on any hidden"
" rank still reports the failing rank and its traceback."
msgstr ""
"各 rank 产生类似的启动消息、警告和模型摘要。启动器默认显示本地 rank 0，使控制台易于阅读。训练指标本就来自全局 rank 0；即使隐藏的 "
"rank 崩溃，仍会报告出错 rank 及其异常堆栈。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:242
msgid "Show output from every rank when processes appear to disagree:"
msgstr "进程表现似乎不一致时，显示所有 rank 的输出："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:249
msgid ""
"For a clean console and complete per-rank logs on disk, use ``torchrun`` log"
" redirection:"
msgstr "要保持控制台简洁，并在磁盘上保存完整的逐 rank 日志，使用 ``torchrun`` 日志重定向："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:257
msgid ""
"The log filtering options apply to PyTorch workflows. skrl with JAX writes "
"every rank to the console."
msgstr "日志过滤选项适用于 PyTorch 工作流程。使用 JAX 的 skrl 会将所有 rank 输出到控制台。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:263
msgid "Train across multiple nodes"
msgstr "跨节点训练"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:265
msgid ""
"Every node must have the same Isaac Lab checkout, dependencies, task "
"configuration, and access to training assets. The nodes must also be able to"
" reach one another on the rendezvous port."
msgstr "各节点必须使用相同的 Isaac Lab 代码、依赖和任务配置，并能访问训练资产。节点间还必须能够通过会合端口通信。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:269
msgid ""
"Choose one node as the rendezvous host. For a two-node PyTorch job with four"
" GPUs per node, run the following on the first node:"
msgstr "选择一个节点作为会合主机。对于每节点四个 GPU 的双节点 PyTorch 作业，在第一个节点运行："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:279
msgid "Run the same command on the second node with its own rank:"
msgstr "在第二个节点使用其自身 rank 运行相同命令："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:288
msgid ""
"The total world size is ``nnodes * num_gpus``: eight ranks in this example. "
"You can also use ``--rdzv_backend``, ``--rdzv_endpoint``, and ``--rdzv_id`` "
"for an elastic ``torchrun`` rendezvous. Add ``--dry_run`` first to verify "
"the command on each node."
msgstr ""
"总进程数（world size）为 ``nnodes * num_gpus`` ，此例为八个 rank。也可以通过 ``--rdzv_backend``"
" 、 ``--rdzv_endpoint`` 和 ``--rdzv_id`` 配置弹性 ``torchrun`` 会合。先加入 "
"``--dry_run`` ，验证各节点命令。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:293
msgid ""
"Each node names the run folder from its own launch time. When the nodes "
"share storage, pass the same ``--run_timestamp`` value (format ``YYYY-MM-"
"DD_HH-MM-SS``) to ``train_multigpu`` on every node so that all ranks write "
"into one run folder."
msgstr ""
"各节点按自身启动时间命名运行目录。节点共享存储时，应在每个节点的 ``train_multigpu`` 命令中传入相同的 "
"``--run_timestamp`` （格式为 ``YYYY-MM-DD_HH-MM-SS`` ），使所有 rank 写入同一个目录。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:297
msgid ""
"For skrl with JAX, pass ``--nnodes``, ``--node_rank``, an integer "
"``--num_gpus``, and the same ``--coordinator_address`` on every node. Do not"
" pass the PyTorch rendezvous options to a JAX launch."
msgstr ""
"使用 JAX 的 skrl 时，在各节点传入 ``--nnodes`` 、 ``--node_rank`` 、整数 ``--num_gpus`` "
"及相同的 ``--coordinator_address`` 。不要向 JAX 启动命令传入 PyTorch 会合选项。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:301
msgid ""
"Multi-node scaling depends heavily on the network between nodes. A multi-"
"node job can be slower than a single-node job when gradient synchronization "
"dominates the training iteration."
msgstr "多节点扩展性很大程度上取决于节点间网络。如果梯度同步主导训练迭代，多节点作业可能比单节点更慢。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:306
msgid "Troubleshoot distributed training"
msgstr "排查分布式训练问题"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:308
msgid "Start with the smallest useful diagnosis:"
msgstr "从最小而有效的诊断开始："

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:310
msgid ""
"Confirm that the same task, backend, and training arguments work with "
"``isaaclab train`` on one GPU."
msgstr "确认相同任务、后端和训练参数能够通过 ``isaaclab train`` 在单 GPU 上运行。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:312
msgid "Add ``--dry_run`` and check the selected GPU and node counts."
msgstr "加入 ``--dry_run`` ，检查所选 GPU 和节点数量。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:313
msgid ""
"Retry at world sizes 2, 3, and 4. A failure at only one world size often "
"points to the communication transport rather than the task."
msgstr "分别以总进程数 2、3、4 重试。只有某个进程数失败时，通常应检查通信传输层，而非任务。"

#: source/features/multi_gpu.rst:315
msgid "Check GPU placement and interconnects with ``nvidia-smi topo -m``."
msgstr "通过 ``nvidia-smi topo -m`` 检查 GPU 布局和互连。"

